          "text": "<p style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:left\">* Existing prerequisites in the same security account. Other AWS components are provisioned by Terraform.<br>The analyst accesses the account through the Bedrock console or authenticated API / CLI.<br>Results return along the request path. Recommendations only; remediation is separate.<br>Regional resources use the configured Region (default: us-east-2). IAM is account-wide; model inference follows the configured profile.</p>"
